  "text": {
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_MIRROR_COLONY": "Mirror Colony",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_MIRROR_COLONY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]World spell, once: two cities of yours are founded on the largest unowned region.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The first and your capital get a Mirror Gate: a land unit in a city of yours with a Mirror Gate can step through to another one with no enemy unit, its moves spent.",
    "TXT_KEY_TECH_CARD_MIRROR_COLONY_PEDIA": "A city seen in a mirror is a city that can be walked to.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Expert: claim the far land before a rival does; the Mirror Gate takes your army there in a turn.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_MIRROR_COLONY": "Mirror Colony",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_MIRROR_COLONY_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]Two cities of yours are founded on the largest unowned region.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]The first and your capital get a Mirror Gate.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Once per game.",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_MIRROR_GATE": "Step Through the Mirror Gate",
    "TXT_KEY_SPELL_MIRROR_GATE_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]The unit moves to another city of yours with a Mirror Gate and no enemy unit.[NEWLINE][ICON_BULLET]Its moves are spent.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_MIRROR_GATE": "Mirror Gate",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_MIRROR_GATE_HELP": "[ICON_BULLET]A land unit here can step through to another city of yours with a Mirror Gate.",
    "TXT_KEY_BUILDING_MIRROR_GATE_PEDIA": "Two silvered arches, a world apart, that open on each other."
  }
